    <deploymentStatus>Deployed</deploymentStatus>
    <description>One row per thing that happened on a readmission report link at the report site: a code sent, a wrong code, a lockout, an open, a download, a refusal. Carries the caller&apos;s IP address and browser, so a disclosure can be traced to a device as well as to a mailbox. Written by the site in system mode; staff read it from the link record.</description>
